kubeos-metrics-server (0.8.0-1kubeos2) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Ship the unit enablement as a package file. Build hook 9050 called
    systemctl enable for these units, which a package must not do: it aborts a
    chroot build (the trap documented in that hook). A .wants symlink owned by
    dpkg is the same declaration, so a node installed from the archive alone
    comes up identically.

 -- KubeOS <mail@kubeos.in>  Thu, 19 Nov 2026 10:30:00 +0530

kubeos-metrics-server (0.8.0-1kubeos1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging: upstream metrics-server v0.8.0 (linux/amd64) plus the unit
    that used to run /usr/local/bin/metrics-server. The binary is fetched and
    checksum-verified at build time, exactly as build hook 9027 did.

 -- KubeOS <mail@kubeos.in>  Thu, 19 Nov 2026 09:50:00 +0530
